An unofficial patch for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3824883510]GSC Stalker Inventory Official[/url] by Harkness. It needs that mod and is not affiliated with its author. It ships none of the original mod's files.

With more worn slots than vanilla, the original makes you scroll a small strip above the character. This patch puts the character on the left of the EQUIPMENT column and the slots in a vertical strip on the right, so all of them are in view.

[h2]What changes[/h2]
[list]
[*]The slots stand in columns of eight, in the same order as before. More slots add a column, and the character gets narrower.
[*]The slots do not scroll or move. When a large item in hands needs more room, the HANDS panel scrolls instead.
[*]Everything else stays as the original draws it: the art, the tooltips, the weight bar.
[/list]

[h2]Install[/h2]
Load it next to GSC Stalker Inventory Official. A server with verifySignatures = 2 takes the key from this mod's keys folder.

[h2]Checked with[/h2]
[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3420608805]BLR_Player_Slots[/url] (19 slots) and test sets of 22 and 28 slots, in 1280x960, 1600x1000, 1920x1080 and 3840x1600 windows.
[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3803455084]OpenZone Storage[/url]: its weapon rack, Alt+click and search work with the moved slots.

